  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community stabilization in the Borkou, Ennedi, Tibesti region in the north of Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to facilitate stabilization within communities in the (Borkou, Ennedi, Tibesti) BET provinces in the North of Chad. This will be accomplished through implementing a multi-sectoral project that seeks to reinforce basic infrastructure within communities and provide youth with increased economic opportunities while capacitating relevant government institutions to track and respond to internal and cross-border migratory flows. Through addressing drivers of instability within communities (lack of services, limited livelihood opportunities, and secondary movements), the project expands communities&apos; resilience and strengthens governance.</narrative>
  </description>
